<title>USA: Big B plans statement on Revco tender.</title>
<headline>Big B plans statement on Revco tender.</headline>
<dateline>BESSEMER, Ala. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big B Inc will issue a statement later Monday regarding Revco D.S. Inc's tender offer for all of the company's outstanding shares at $15 each, a Big B spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>She did not specify a time.</p>
<p>Big B shares were up 3-1/8 to 15-3/4 in late trading, while Revco shares were off 1/8 to 25-1/2.</p>
<p>Revco said it owned about 5.4 percent of Big B's 22 million common shares outstanding (fully diluted). On that basis, the offer would have a total value of about $330 million.</p>
<p>--Cleveland Newsdesk 216-579-0077</p>
